<title>UK: INSTANT VIEW --NAO REPORT.</title>
<headline>INSTANT VIEW --NAO REPORT.</headline>
<text>
<p>DAVID PHILPOTTS, SCHRODERS &quot;There were no great surprises all round. No black holes came out of this report. The fears that Brown might use this as the trump card to increase taxes have proved unfounded.&quot; &quot;The new assumptions endorsed by the NAO are completely in line with what most people thought was on the cards. These are just new base-line assumptions, not new forecasts and it is still highly likely we will see a significant downward revision for the PSBR forecast for this year and perhaps even next.&quot;</p>
</text>
